      <p class="caption">Battle 1's scans revealed little because the jammer blocks them until it falls; battle 3's time includes the final fight.</p>

      <h3 class="sub-h">{hist.length} runs in one day</h3>
      <p>The bot's runs are how the problems showed up. When I replaced the clearing's capture ring with three beacons, the bot kept stalling at them: one beacon stood 12 m into the trees, the bot wedged itself between trunks beside another for half an hour, and every death set all three beacons back to unlit. Each fix was checked with another run until it finished cleanly.</p>
